- **Modalities:** not published. Free stealth routes in this class have been text-in/text-out with reasoning and tool calling, but nothing is verified for Cat Jam specifically.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-16):** $0 on the observed free route (standard Zen free-tier caveats: prompts may be used to improve the model; limited-time by precedent — cf. exo-free's HTTP 410 removal).
- **Architecture:** unknown/anonymous — no parameter count, no weights, no vendor. Community identity speculation found zero corroboration in this pass (DuckDuckGo rate-limited; Bing returned no relevant results; BenchLM has no page).

